  <section id="about" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
        <h2>Two generations, one toolbox</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>N &amp; N Lyte's Plumbing Services is owned and run by a father-and-son team, built on the idea that a plumber's word should be as solid as the pipe work. We take on the small household jobs alongside larger contractor and development projects, and treat both with the same care.</p>
        <p>Our clients span the island: homeowners and landlords, building contractors and property developers, and the event planners who call us in for a fete or a corporate function. Different jobs, same standard.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

